      "content_sha256": "8d1f89845e139455f8c7b41d2cb5d275bd2d1fdda7c26223889e4670a0a98201"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The preceding points can be formalized by least-squares regression of genotypic values on the number of $ B_{1} $ and $ B_{2} $ alleles in the genotype ( $ N_{1} $ and $ N_{2} $),",
