    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Unlike the univariate regression discussed in Chapter 3, Equation 4.5a is a multiple regression, the properties of which are discussed in Chapter 8. For the two-allele case, however, we can reduce the model to a standard univariate regression by noting that for any individual, $ N_{1}=2-N_{2} $, so that",
